WEBVTT

00:15:28.701 --> 00:15:30.938
[Them folks misunderestimated me]

00:15:30.962 --> 00:15:35.050
(Laughter)

00:15:35.582 --> 00:15:38.976
The survey that I quoted,
which is the ARIS survey,

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:42.048
didn't break down its data
by socio-economic class or education,

00:15:42.072 --> 00:15:43.794
IQ or anything else.

00:15:43.818 --> 00:15:47.976
But a recent article by Paul G. Bell
in the Mensa magazine

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:49.976
provides some straws in the wind.

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:52.477
Mensa, as you know,
is an international organization

00:15:52.501 --> 00:15:55.811
for people with very high IQ.

00:15:55.835 --> 00:16:00.770
And from a meta-analysis
of the literature,